// onsa.toml
// [test]
// spec = ["§4.4", "§18.1"]

// S-264, R-298 (W4-05 U2): a chain of 3000 aliases `type Bk = Option[B(k-1)]` is finished by the check
// in a short time. The depth of Bk is k (spec §4.4), so B257 is the first to pass 256 and is the one
// E0422; the aliases after it have no diagnostic (they use the error type). The time of the check
// grows with the length of the chain by no more than a small power (the chain of 3000 took about 3
// seconds in the check of 2296e83, W4-05 U1/b).

